---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import { PRIJZEN, TEKST } from "../../config";

const titel = "ISO 27001 gap scan and security questionnaire";
const beschrijving =
  `ISO 27001 gap analysis for a SaaS, IT or MSP firm. Includes preparing a security questionnaire when that is the trigger. ${PRIJZEN.instap.en}.`;
---

<Base titel={titel} beschrijving={beschrijving} taal="en" lees>
  <h1>{titel}</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    The entry offer is an ISO 27001 gap analysis, or preparing a security
    questionnaire, when a customer asks for it.
  </p>

  <h2>Who and when</h2>
  <p>
    For a Dutch organisation of 10 to 40 FTE: a SaaS firm, an IT provider or
    an MSP. The trigger is a customer's date or a tender: ISO 27001, or
    completing a security questionnaire.
  </p>

  <h2>Contents</h2>
  <p>
    Document review, interviews, and a gap register. If the trigger is a
    security questionnaire, a prepared or completed list, as far as the
    documents allow.
  </p>

  <h2>Price</h2>
  <p>
    Gap scan or the security-questionnaire track: {PRIJZEN.instap.en}. For
    organisations of 10 to 40 FTE.
  </p>

  <h2>What can follow</h2>
  <p>
    A next step can be to outsource the ISO 27001 internal audit: an
    independent internal audit (not a certification audit). An AVG baseline
    on the same system, implementation support, or a retainer for follow-up
    can come after. None of those has a published price. The next step is the
    intake.
  </p>

  <h2>Independence</h2>
  <p>
    Haldrecht never internally audits an ISMS it built. I do not issue a
    certificate. Accredited certification bodies do that. I do not judge the
    statute. Assurance in the descriptor is not an accountant's assurance
    report.
  </p>

  <p><a class="knop" href="/en/contact/">{TEKST.en.cta}</a></p>
</Base>
